  "gotchas": [
    "Only one PENDING transfer per merchant at a time: a new call while one awaits admin approval returns 422 transfer_already_pending.",
    "The transfer is COMPLETED immediately only if WALLET_TRANSFER_AUTO_APPROVE is enabled; otherwise it stays PENDING until an admin approves it, and the target wallet is not credited before then.",
    "Send an Idempotency-Key: without it a network retry reserves the amount a second time. Reusing a key with a different body, or while the first call is still running, returns 409."
